    given-names: Ben
version: 0.16.0
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/BenCurtis2003/potemkin-bench"
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - reinforcement learning
  - AI agents
  - honesty
  - reward hacking
abstract: >-
  Multi-step back-office agent tasks (finance, HR, IT, procurement and CRM) run against a mock database, email and files,
  scored on the true end state, with the agent's self-report scored separately so false success
  (claimed done, wasn't) is measured directly.
